{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"cmake","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"CMake","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for CMake (.cmake).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"cmake","name":"CMake","extensions":[".cmake"],"grammar":"grammars/cmake.json","filenames":["CMakeLists.txt"],"lineComment":"#","blockComment":["#[[","]]"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"CMake","path":"snippets/cmake.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/cmake.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#\\\\[\\\\[\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\]\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{[A-Za-z0-9_]+\\\\}|\\\\$ENV\\\\{[A-Za-z0-9_]+\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:endfunction|endforeach|endwhile|function|endmacro|continue|foreach|elseif|return|endif|while|macro|break|else|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:INTERFACE|REQUIRED|PRIVATE|PUBLIC|FALSE|TRUE|OFF|ON)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:target_compile_definitions|target_include_directories|target_compile_features|cmake_minimum_required|target_link_libraries|include_directories|add_custom_command|add_custom_target|add_subdirectory|link_directories|add_definitions|add_executable|target_sources|find_package|find_library|add_library|project|include|install|message|option|string|list|file|set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/cmake.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Project\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proj\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"cmake_minimum_required(VERSION ${1:3.20})\",\n      \"project(${2:name} LANGUAGES ${3:CXX})\",\n      \"set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD ${4:20})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A project header\"\n  },\n  \"Executable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"exe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"add_executable(${1:app} ${2:main.cpp})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An executable\"\n  },\n  \"Library\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lib\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"add_library(${1:lib} ${2:src.cpp})\",\n      \"target_include_directories(${1:lib} PUBLIC ${3:include})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A library\"\n  },\n  \"Find package\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"find_package(${1:Package} REQUIRED)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"find_package\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# CMake\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for CMake.\n\n## Files\n\n`.cmake`, `CMakeLists.txt`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `proj` | A project header |\n| `exe` | An executable |\n| `lib` | A library |\n| `fp` | find_package |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}